  h1="Contractual control agreements: the complete guide."
  lede="From 6 April 2027, options, conditional contracts, pre-emption rights and promotion agreements over registered land in England and Wales have to be reported to HM Land Registry. From April 2028 they go public. This is the whole regime on one page."
